{
  "_comment": "TowerDef3D WORLD physics (ADR 0009 Phase 3b). Enemy waypoint advance, tower cooldown, tower fires, projectile hits enemy, enemy death animation. Wave clock, build/upgrade economy, score, and enemy-at-base lives loss live in game/rules.json.",
  "rules": [
    {
      "_comment": "=== PATH-FOLLOWING ===",
      "_": "Enemy near a waypoint (radius 1.2) \u2192 velocity is set toward the NEXT waypoint's position (not just an axis direction). Each waypoint stores next_x/next_z = the position of the next node. This is homing \u2014 enemies auto-correct perpendicular drift instead of accumulating it. Speed factor 2 = enemy speed (2 m/s). Caught during user playtest: 'enemy forgot to turn' was actually drift accumulation across multiple waypoints.",
      "id": "enemy_advance_at_waypoint",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "contact"
      },
      "query": {
        "a": {
          "tags_all": [
            "enemy"
          ]
        },
        "b": {
          "tags_all": [
            "waypoint"
          ]
        },
        "radius": 1.2
      },
      "effect": {
        "type": "velocity_set",
        "target": "a",
        "x": "(b.state.next_x - a.state.position.x) / max(sqrt(pow(b.state.next_x - a.state.position.x, 2) + pow(b.state.next_z - a.state.position.z, 2)), 0.1) * 2",
        "y": 0,
        "z": "(b.state.next_z - a.state.position.z) / max(sqrt(pow(b.state.next_x - a.state.position.x, 2) + pow(b.state.next_z - a.state.position.z, 2)), 0.1) * 2"
      }
    },
    {
      "_comment": "=== TOWER COMBAT ===",
      "_": "Tower cooldown ticks down each frame.",
      "id": "tower_cooldown_tick",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "tick",
        "interval": 1
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "tower"
        ]
      },
      "effect": {
        "type": "state_add",
        "target": "self",
        "field": "cooldown",
        "amount": -0.1
      }
    },
    {
      "_": "Tower fires at FIRST enemy in range when cooldown \u2264 0. once_per_a: true means the tower fires once per tick (one projectile, one target), even if multiple enemies are in range. Without this, contact would fire per pair and the tower would spawn N projectiles for N enemies \u2014 the classic TD invariant 'one tower \u2192 one shot per cooldown' broken.",
      "id": "tower_fires",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "contact"
      },
      "query": {
        "a": {
          "tags_all": [
            "tower"
          ],
          "state": {
            "cooldown_lte": 0.0
          }
        },
        "b": {
          "tags_all": [
            "enemy"
          ]
        },
        "radius": 6.0,
        "once_per_a": true
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "template": "projectile",
          "position": [
            "a.state.position.x",
            0.6,
            "a.state.position.z"
          ],
          "overrides": {
            "state": {
              "velocity": [
                "(b.state.position.x - a.state.position.x) / max(sqrt(pow(b.state.position.x - a.state.position.x, 2) + pow(b.state.position.z - a.state.position.z, 2)), 1) * 14",
                0,
                "(b.state.position.z - a.state.position.z) / max(sqrt(pow(b.state.position.x - a.state.position.x, 2) + pow(b.state.position.z - a.state.position.z, 2)), 1) * 14"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "state_set",
          "target": "a",
          "field": "cooldown",
          "value": "a.properties.fire_cooldown"
        },
        {
          "type": "emit_shell_event",
          "event": "play_sound",
          "name": "shoot"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_": "Projectile damages enemy on contact.",
      "id": "projectile_hits_enemy",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "contact"
      },
      "query": {
        "a": {
          "tags_all": [
            "projectile"
          ]
        },
        "b": {
          "tags_all": [
            "enemy"
          ]
        },
        "radius": 0.6
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "b",
          "field": "hp",
          "amount": -1
        },
        {
          "type": "remove",
          "target": "a"
        },
        {
          "type": "emit_shell_event",
          "event": "play_sound",
          "name": "hit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_": "Enemy death: hp \u2264 0 \u2192 4 sparks, shake, +5 gold, decrement enemies_alive, remove.",
      "id": "enemy_death",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "tick",
        "interval": 1
      },
      "query": {
        "tags_all": [
          "enemy"
        ],
        "state": {
          "hp_lte": 0
        }
      },
      "effect": [
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "template": "particle_spark",
          "position": [
            "self.state.position.x",
            0.6,
            "self.state.position.z"
          ],
          "overrides": {
            "state": {
              "velocity": [
                1.5,
                1.0,
                1.5
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "template": "particle_spark",
          "position": [
            "self.state.position.x",
            0.6,
            "self.state.position.z"
          ],
          "overrides": {
            "state": {
              "velocity": [
                -1.5,
                1.0,
                1.5
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "template": "particle_spark",
          "position": [
            "self.state.position.x",
            0.6,
            "self.state.position.z"
          ],
          "overrides": {
            "state": {
              "velocity": [
                1.5,
                1.0,
                -1.5
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "spawn",
          "template": "particle_spark",
          "position": [
            "self.state.position.x",
            0.6,
            "self.state.position.z"
          ],
          "overrides": {
            "state": {
              "velocity": [
                -1.5,
                1.0,
                -1.5
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "emit_shell_event",
          "event": "shake",
          "intensity": 0.05,
          "duration": 6
        },
        {
          "type": "emit_shell_event",
          "event": "play_sound",
          "name": "kill"
        },
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "player",
          "field": "gold",
          "amount": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "state_add",
          "target": "clock_1",
          "field": "enemies_alive",
          "amount": -1
        },
        {
          "type": "remove",
          "target": "self"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}